{"step_index":1494,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T17:51:41Z","content":"### Universal Gesture Engine Upgrade (Web Touch + Mobile PanResponder)\n\n### Why Swiping Wasn't Registering on Mobile Web\n1. **Browser Touch-Action Interference:** On mobile browsers (Safari on iOS & Chrome on Android), when elements are nested inside a scrollable container, the browser handles touches natively for vertical scrolling and cancels synthetic JavaScript gesture tracking (`touchcancel`) unless explicit horizontal gesture listeners and `touchAction: 'pan-y'` are attached to the DOM node.\n2. **Responder Interception:** React Native Web's default `PanResponder` was waiting on internal synthetic touch events that the browser's touch pipeline swallowed before reaching the threshold.\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ What Has Been Implemented ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\n\n1. **Direct Universal Touch Engine:**\n   - Attached direct `onTouchStart`, `onTouchMove`, `onTouchEnd`, and mouse events directly to the card container.\n   - Accurately tracks horizontal drag distance (`dx`) and distinguishes between intentional horizontal swipes (`|dx| > 10px` & `|dx| > |dy|`) and standard vertical scrolling.\n   - Configured `touchAction: 'pan-y'` and `userSelect: 'none'` on the card to prevent browser touch cancellation.\n\n2. **Immediate Dual Triggers:**\n   - **Swiping Right (> 50px) ➔**: Illuminates **`📞 RELEASE TO DIAL`** in green, and on release triggers `handleDial()` / `tel:...` immediately in the user gesture event loop with medium haptic pulse.\n   - **Swiping Left (< -50px) ➔**: Illuminates **`⏭️ RELEASE TO SKIP`** in amber, and on release triggers `advanceNextLead()` immediately with tick haptics and smooth card slide-off animation.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Production Deployment Live\nThe universal gesture build is live and ready to test:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
